<title>HONG KONG: HK bourse investigating trade in Cheung Kong shrs.</title>
<headline>HK bourse investigating trade in Cheung Kong shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Tuesday it was investigating &quot;suspected erroneous&quot; transactions in shares of Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Cheung Kong shares traded at HK$56.25 at the opening on Tuesday compared with Monday's closing price of HK$65.75. The low for the day was later changed by the stock exchange to HK$60.00.</p>
<p>&quot;The exchange is investigating the matter with the relevant members,&quot; the stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>At midday, Cheung Kong shares traded down HK$1.50 to HK$64.25. -- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
